{{Unobtainable}}
'''Yuki Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that could be obtained as a Stamp Reward during the [[Shoumetsu Toshi Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 3.6 Update|Version 3.6]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 181
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Yuki Cat
|name2 = Lovely Yuki Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Lovely Yuki Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit can be helpful in the early game if you do not own anything better such as [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Shaman cat]]. It has longer range, but shorter uptime and TBA than Shaman, so it can be used as a secondary layer of them in case your Shaman stack falls, which can happen easily in [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon Chapter 3]] against [[Teacher Bun Bun]], as Shaman outranges it by 50, but Yuki outranges by 140. This leads to it being a decent Bun Bun counter as long as the peons are taken care of. However, it falls off after early game because the large presence of [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] completely outclasses it.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & User Rank Dump}}

